Subject: CPMS I03A Host Admission Evidence Protocol Data Design

@ [design_uuid] 06e0a064-fdf2-4d3f-92a7-a6057f021638
@ [source_uuid] 8bbe3fc5-13a4-43d3-8e9e-50aa486b67fa

& [ChannelSnapshot] fields
  + log_name provider enabled mode maximum_size record_count oldest_record_id newest_record_id oldest_time newest_time configuration_digest accessibility

& [CommandEnvelope] fields
  + executable_path executable_bytes executable_sha256 arguments working_directory source_commit cargo_lock_sha256 toolchain target profile feature_set offline environment_projection timeout expected_stage

& [EnvironmentProjection] fields
  + variable_name disposition value_or_digest rationale
  + disposition included excluded_secret excluded_unneeded presence_only or unavailable

& [ProcessResult] fields
  + started terminal_state native_exit_code started_at ended_at stdout_bytes stdout_sha256 stderr_bytes stderr_sha256 wrapper_fault

& [ArtifactObservation] fields
  + path role state bytes sha256 pe_machine signature_status signer_chain_digest generated_stage launch_evidence

& [PolicyEvent] fields
  + channel_generation record_id event_id time_created provider process_path target_path policy_id policy_level raw_xml_bytes raw_xml_sha256 normalized_projection_digest attribution

& [HostAdmissionAttemptCore] fields
  + profile attempt_id predecessor input_bindings pre_channel command result post_channel continuity artifacts events accounts limits disposition faults

& [ReviewEnvelope] fields
  + attempt_core_digest scribe_refiner_weaver_planner_honesty_security_observer_receipts combined_disposition reviewer_independence authority_limit predecessor_review digest

& [SignatureAttachment] fields
  + envelope_digest algorithm key_id trust_catalogue_digest signature_bytes verification_disposition

& [ClosedTerminalState] is exit_success exit_failure launch_blocked launch_fault timed_out cancelled or wrapper_fault
& [ClosedArtifactState] is absent not_generated generated_not_launched launched_pass launched_fail or launch_blocked
& [ClosedAttemptDisposition] is admitted_pass behavioral_fail launch_blocked build_incomplete launch_fault timed_out cancelled evidence_incomplete or wrapper_fault

& [FiniteLimits] are at most 64 attempts 4096 events 4096 artifacts 1024 arguments 67108864 stdout bytes 67108864 stderr bytes 16777216 XML bytes per event and 1073741824 total bytes per attempt
  + path maximum is 32768 UTF-16 code units
  + checked arithmetic governs all totals ranges and allocations

& [CanonicalEncoding] uses fixed field order sorted records normalized times with offset exact bytes domain-separated SHA256 and no localized text as sole identity
& [SecretBoundary] no complete environment credential token private key certificate private material browser state or command history enters normative evidence
& [DataBoundary] formation creates record forms only and zero attempts exports artifacts signatures or executions
& [DesignDisposition] is complete_for_protocol_formation
